## Notes

- **Urgency:** This purchase was made to address a last-minute shortage of extension cords identified on the morning of 2026-03-27. The shortage was flagged after additional audiovisual equipment was requested for the Dean of Engineering’s lecture.
- **Delivery Confirmation:** The items were picked up directly from the supplier by a logistics team member at 10:30 AM on 2026-03-27.
- **Usage:** The extension cords and power strips were installed and tested by 3:30 PM on the same day, ensuring readiness for the Orientation Day event.
- **Incident Follow-Up:** A review of inventory management procedures will be conducted post-event to avoid similar shortages in the future.

